<title>ITALY: Autostrade 1996 net profit rises 3.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Autostrade 1996 net profit rises 3.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>	  Parent net profit	160    vs   155</p>
<p>	  Parent sales	   2,786    vs 2,715</p>
<p>	  Net financial debt   4,685    vs 4,954</p>
<p>	  Proposed ord div    110 lire  vs same</p>
<p>	  Cons attrib profit     160    vs   165</p>
<p>	  Cons sales	     3,254    up 5.4 pct</p>
<p>	  Cons net debt	  4,669    vs 5,165</p>
<p>Note - Toll-road operator Societa Autostrade SpA is controlled by state industrial holding IRI and is slated for privatisation.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
